<title>UK: Graystone buys caravan accessories firm.</title>
<headline>Graystone buys caravan accessories firm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Graystone Plc said on Friday that it has acquired Grove Products (Caravan Accessories) Ltd for an initial 1.25 million stg in cash and shares.</p>
<p>The engineering and distribution group said the purchase price comprises 1.05 million stg in cash and 1,352,657 ordinary shares issued at a price of 14.79p. A further consideration of up to a maximum 350,000 stg will be payable based on the results for the year ending 31 December 1997. Grove is a distributor of caravan accessories.</p>
<p>--London newsroom  +44 171 542 4019</p>
